w: And I love that old cross where the dear- est and best For a world of lost sin- ners was slain. *
w: For the dear Lamb of God left His glo- ry a- bove To * bear it to dark Cal- va- ry. *
w: For 'twas on that old cross Je- sus suf- fered and died, To * par- don and sanc- ti- fy me. *
w: Then He'll call me some- day to my home far a- way, Where His glo- ry for- ev- er I'll share. *
